 -2026/
CATEGORIES:Law,International,Policy,Entrepreneurship
DESCRIPTION:Bennett School of Public Policy\nTopics: Law\, International\, 
 Policy\, Entrepreneurship\nDetails: https://www.bennettschool.cam.ac.uk/ev
 ents/annual-public-policy-lecture-2026/\nSign-up needed: https://www.event
 brite.co.uk/e/annual-public-policy-lecture-were-all-going-to-die-or-are-we
 -tickets-2003663362053\nDrawing on her experience as an entrepreneur\, leg
 islator and board member\, Martha Lane Fox will explore what AI could mean
  for the next 50 years\, including its effects on work\, business\, entrep
 reneurial opportunity\, existing institutions\, culture\, security and def
 ence. Chaired by Prof Diane Coyle\, Bennett Professor of Public Policy\, U
 niversity of Cambridge.
